0.1.4 (2026-11-04)
  * Show, beside an entry that is not installed, the install-time downloads it brings (the packages apt would install for it whose control file declares Install-Download-Size and Install-Download-Source), with size and source, on a metered connection and, said, when NetworkManager cannot be read (ORDER 399b; Daniel, 2026-11-04: "warn the user with current size on stereo aptus interface or apt"). One declaration and one reader, shared with apt's own notice (sparky-stereo-apt 20261104.3, which this version depends on), in the nine languages.
  * FlightGear joins the catalogue (stereo programs section): its data downloader declares 1.75 GiB.

